     1599   ON RETURN OF BR-gds-hist IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1600   DO:
     1601       run proc-br-gds-hist in this-procedure no-error.
     1602     if error-status:error then return no-apply.
     1603   END.
     1604   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF BR-gds-hist IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1605   DO:
     1606     run proc-view-changes in this-procedure no-error.
     1607   END.
     1608   ON CTRL-J OF sch-corr-date IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
