     1610      run proc-find-corr-date in this-procedure(yes, input frame Dialog-Frame sch-corr-date) no-error.
     1611     if error-status:error then return no-apply.
     1612   END.
     1613   ON RETURN OF sch-corr-date IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1614   DO:
     1615     run proc-find-corr-date in this-procedure(no, input frame Dialog-Frame sch-corr-date) no-error.
     1616     if error-status:error then return no-apply.
     1617   END.
     1618   ON CTRL-J OF sch-corr-user-name IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
