     5607   Line format "X(177)" AT 1 SKIP
     5608   "Продолжение - на следующей странице" AT 30 SKIP
     5609   with FRAME BottomFrame width 232 PAGE-BOTTOM NO-LABELS NO-BOX .
     5610   VIEW  STREAM PrnLibStream FRAME BottomFrame .
     5611   FORM with FRAME HistoryList  .
     5612   run waitfram-show in this-procedure ("Ждите...").
     5613     GET next br-gds-hist.
